                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْصَعَتْ بِوَلَدِهَا</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>She</i> (a woman) <i>brought forth,</i>
or <i>cast forth, her child with a single moan,</i> or
<i>hard breathing</i> [or <i>with a single throe;</i>] like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَكَبَتْ بِهِ</span>. (IAar, L, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حفد</span>.)

